---
import FeaturedInfographicPage from "../components/FeaturedInfographicPage.astro";
---

<FeaturedInfographicPage
  title="Hero Release Events"
  description="Mission guides designed to maximize unlock chances."
  imageSrc="/images/hre.png"
  imageAlt="Hero Release Event Infographic"
  basicsTitle="Hero Release Event Basics"
  basicsContent={`
## Event Timing

Hero Release Events run for **14 days** and focus on unlocking a newly released Hero.

## Event Goal

The primary objective is to earn **Event Shards** to unlock the featured Hero.

* Additional shards can be used to further promote the Hero after unlocking them.
* Progress carries significant value even if you do not fully complete the event.

## How Progress Works

Event Shards are earned by completing event Missions and continuing your normal daily gameplay.

Activities that contribute to progress include:

* Campaign battles
* Arena battles
* Guild Raid attacks
* Event-specific Missions

Most players will earn the majority of their shards simply by playing the game consistently throughout the event.

## What to Expect

Unlocking the featured Hero is very achievable with daily participation, even for newer players.

Reaching higher promotion levels requires a stronger roster, careful preparation, and efficient completion of event Missions.

Players pursuing Legendary promotions should expect to plan ahead, optimize mission completion, and potentially invest additional resources.

`}
>
  <section slot="guides" class="daras-guide" aria-labelledby="daras-guide-heading">
    <a href="/heroes/daras/" class="daras-guide-link" data-hero-guide-link>
      <img
        src="/images/hero-round/Daras.webp"
        alt=""
        width="80"
        height="80"
        loading="lazy"
      />
      <div>
        <h2 id="daras-guide-heading">Daras Hero Guide</h2>
        <p>Explore Daras’s stats, abilities and hero assessment.</p>
      </div>
      <span class="guide-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
    </a>
  </section>
</FeaturedInfographicPage>

<style>
  .daras-guide {
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .daras-guide-link {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 80px minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid #685930;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: #1e1e1e;
    color: #ffffff;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .daras-guide-link:hover,
  .daras-guide-link:focus-visible {
    border-color: #d4af37;
  }

  .daras-guide-link:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid #d4af37;
    outline-offset: 4px;
  }

  .daras-guide-link img {
    display: block;
    width: 80px;
    height: 80px;
    object-fit: contain;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .daras-guide-link h2 {
    margin: 0;
    color: #d4af37;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .daras-guide-link p {
    margin: 0.4rem 0 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .guide-arrow {
    color: #d4af37;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .daras-guide {
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }

    .daras-guide-link {
      grid-template-columns: 64px minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 1rem;
      padding: 1rem;
    }

    .daras-guide-link img {
      width: 64px;
      height: 64px;
    }

    .guide-arrow {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
